WEBVTT

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.160
So...

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.160
You set Tsutsun up to be branded
as a lolicon yourself, huh?

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.830
You're nothing but garbage...

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.080
Big Brother! Let's say it was
a misunderstanding and apologize to everyone!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.330
A-apologize?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.660
Me... humble myself to him?!
Well, hello there.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.910
The one thing... The one thing I won't do!

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.370
Big Brother!
The one thing... The one thing I won't do!

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.870
How mean...

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.580
It's hard for you too, right?

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.160
It's tougher for Kaoru than me...

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:40.290
It's okay. I'll do something about this.

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.330
Oh, there, that's him, right?

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.250
He tried to take a little kid...

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.660
Episode 5
About When I Tried to Make Summer Memories.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.000
He totally looks like he would, huh?

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:22.580
I'd rather be called creepy and have
stones thrown at me. I hate scaring people.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.330
Wh-what do you want? I'm not apologizing, you know!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.950
I didn't even say anything, though.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.160
Shouldn't I be the one who says I'm not doing anything?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.910
That was just a joke...

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:42.250
You guys think you can just say
"it's a joke" and everything's fine...?

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:46.200
The unpredictability of you jokesters
is a big problem for me!

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.410
Don't take whatever grudges
you have from the past out on me!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:53.200
Basically, when making an apology,
there's no one that would believe me over you.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:57.370
I've gotten negligent in my efforts to be trusted.

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:01.200
I think that's my fault.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:03.450
Y-

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.040
Hey! Micchan! What're you doing?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.040
Hey, that guy... isn't he the one
that everyone's talking about on the streets?

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.290
Why are you talking with him?

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.450
Er... This is...

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.620
There's no way I'm talking to a guy like this!
Yeah freakin' right!

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:24.040
I seriously can't trust a lolicon. Let's go!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.450
Trash... That guy is trash!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.910
Wait, Tsutsui. Let's walk home together.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.790
I told you, we can't.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.830
No! We're going together.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.370
Ito...

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.500
You really are a good person.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.950
Did you just notice that?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.160
No, I knew it.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.620
Tsutsun! It's not fair that you're going home with Ito!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.450
There are two good people here...

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.830
and what's more, one is my girlfriend!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.750
This is the best!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.120
I see, so you heard, huh?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.500
I really can't forgive that person.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.870
How can I knock that conceited jerk
down a peg, I wonder...

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.580
Hey, that's scary.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:21.660
Tsutsun, you should have just properly
explained it to me that he set you up.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.830
W-well... it's that...

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.830
I can't complain to you about a guy
who says he likes you, right?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.620
Also, there's a previous instance of you
hitting people with your bag...

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.910
Forget about that.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:42.370
Tsutsun, you're still being misunderstood
even though you've done nothing wrong, right?

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:47.620
It's fine. Since you're not
misunderstanding anything, that's enough...

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.540
Tsutsun...

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.040
Wh-what is it this time?

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.660
I love you.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.580
Okay.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.870
How can you be so easygoing?
You probably don't even understand how I'm feeling...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.830
What do you want?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.160
Don't "what do you want?" me!

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:22.870
I've been spending my days so terrified
that the people around me will find out about you!

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.120
But I didn't do anyth-

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:28.200
You're always spending your time watching anime,
and gaming, and you don't put effort into anything!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.910
Thanks to you, everything is just average!

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.040
I'm not really all that carefree, though!

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:35.540
I'm not going to grow up
to be anything like you, you idiot!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.870
Thank you for having me.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.660
Oh, Iroha.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.330
I wonder if that boy's future is okay...

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.830
It's okay.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:50.120
Hey, is there a girl named Anzu
who's in the same grade as you?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.790
Huh? You know her?

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.910
Who's that? Who's Anzu?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.620
Aww, let your mom know, too!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:04.160
My mom is really nosy with that type of thing so we can't.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:05.950
Do you like her?

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.750
That isn't it! Why does everyone
keep asking me that about girls?!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.660
That's stupid. I hate it.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.750
But Anzu isn't bad or anything. She's a good kid.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.910
I don't really know... is all.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.120
You seem like you want to be a cool kid.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:26.830
He'd probably get mad if I say
that he's like Tsutsun, though.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.700
See you!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.660
I kinda feel like this is escalating quickly...

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.700
PERVERT

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.410
PERVERT

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.750
Wha-?! A boiled egg?!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.660
That's somewhat thoughtful...

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.250
You're stupid.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:56.450
At least say something back!
You just let them do whatever they want...

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.080
It's your fault that things have come to this.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.870
You can't just half-heartedly get caught up
in a guilty conscience. Don't get angry.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.950
Micchan! You're talking to that guy again?

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.160
That's embarrassing, stop it!

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:10.160
It's not that big of a deal...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.540
Is he your friend?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.830
It's because he gets along super well
with your sister! Is that why?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.040
Of course not!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.500
He's panicking! That's shady...

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.410
Seriously, stop saying stupid-ass things!

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.160
Is this a falling out?

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.080
Okay, then tell us.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.330
You're being annoying.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.080
What are you getting so serious about?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.950
Hey, stop it.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.410
Don't lump me together with that normie.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.950
You think we'd get along
when I have a grudge against him, ya dummy?

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:43.910
PERVERT

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.040
What's up with him?

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.750
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.290
You stay away from him too, Micchan. Jeez.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.540
It seems kinda rough for normies, too.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.620
Hey.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.660
You again? What do you want?

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.950
What the hell is up with you?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:03.910
Huh?

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:07.290
Be aggressive and just bring it! You're unresponsive!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.790
What the hell is up with YOU, though?

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.540
I get it now! You're just an attention whore, aren't you?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.500
No, I'm not!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.580
Don't you think you're being idiotic?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:18.160
Getting hit, having to wear wet clothes,
being talked about behind your back...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.700
why are you taking all of that?
You sit there and do freakin' nothing!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:25.790
That's because everyone knows
that the things in life are idiotic.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:26.660
Huh?

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:32.580
That isn't true. There are things that will
pay off if you work hard at them.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.200
It's because you believed that way that you came this far.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.580
You can't do anything about the inevitable.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.250
But now, so many things are going
way too well for me it's scary...

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:47.000
So this here is perfectly fine.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.330
I can't tell if you're being gloomy or optimistic.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.160
What the hell is even going so right for you?

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.000
Huh? I'm very happy right now, you know.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.450
What's your happiness? Is it making a hundred friends?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.700
No!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.750
Well, I won't be telling you to apologize or anything.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:10.700
Since you're very egoistic, it looks like
there's a lot of things you want to maintain.

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:16.540
Just, with Ito... as long as you don't
interfere with him, it's all okay.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:21.330
Oh! Sorry! I do need you to come
to just one place after all!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.120
Huh?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.620
Um... And so, there was a slight
misunderstanding on my part.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.370
I'm really sorry about that.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:37.080
Kaoru's big brother was just trying to help me, is all.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.200
A misunderstanding?! It was
a misunderstanding then, right?!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.790
I'm sorry to you too, Kaoru!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.620
Nah... It's the fault of my brother
who tends to be misunderstood...

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.620
You apologize, too. You were thoroughly abusive.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.910
Are you sure? Shouldn't it be more straightforward?

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:56.790
It's enough. I was thinking that there would be
no more human rights the rest of my life in this house.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.700
Anzu, you can't just go along with people you don't know.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.000
Right. I'm really sorry.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:12.200
Well, okay... Now everything around me
will operate normally. This is very nice.

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:17.410
Anzu will not be around you again, jerk.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.080
What are you talking about?

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.540
Huh?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.040
What's this ensemble here?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.290
I need you to tell one more person.
She's my only female friend.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:32.330
Oh... Uh... It's about the rumors about him...

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:37.000
TURN

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:37.250
I'm Arisa Ishino! Nice to meet you!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.410
Huh? Uh... yeah.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.910
Your number! Let's exchange numbers, please!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.290
Uh... Huh? What? My number?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.290
I knew Ishino was a poor judge of character.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.290
Oh, no! Is this kid your little sister? I think she's super cute!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.620
I knew Ishino was a poor judge of character.

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.620
Oh, no! Is this kid your little sister? I think she's super cute!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.450
Oh, no! Is this kid your little sister? I think she's super cute!

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.500
People are interesting.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.500
Oh, no! Is this kid your little sister? I think she's super cute!

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.620
Yeah, she IS cute, but...

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.290
Tsutsun, the part of you that's tolerant like this...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.120
I love you.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.160
Ugghh...

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:00.750
REPLAY

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:03.910
Thanks to binge-watching Ezomichi yesterday,
I'm so sleepy...

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.700
I'm late, I'm late!

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:06.620
I'm sorry!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.950
Ouch...

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.580
I'm sorry! Are you alright?!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.290
I-I'm okay. Glasses, glasses...

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.580
M-me too! Glasses, glasses...

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.790
MATH III

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:24.290
Senpai... I'm really sorry! I'm such a klutz.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:29.500
No, same here. Sorry I was all spaced out.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:30.830
Bye...

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:36.750
Huh?

