00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.120
What?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.750
Well... because I like that magazine too,
and I have a subscription to it!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:30.410
It's a minor part of it, but the modeling
and the interviews are fulfilling too!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:34.620
I thought it was somewhat geared towards fujoshi,
but I can't believe that it's also read by guys!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.160
