00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:07.080
A festival? Tonight?

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.950
Yeah. It's happening in my neighborhood.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:15.040
Well... I haven't been to one in a while,
so I have no confidence.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.500
