00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.450
Because when I surrounded myself
with fun-looking people,

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.040
I felt like I rapidly kept getting smaller and smaller.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.450
I'm going to buy a candied apple.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.500
What's up with that guy? He's so frumpy!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.200
