00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.500
I'm angry!

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.040
Have you heard anything I've said up till now?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.580
I mean, I've been listening to you properly, but...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:01.080
Sometimes I have problem with the part of you
that thinks you're so inferior to others.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.580
If I liked hot guys, I'd be dating a hot guy from the start!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.040
Uh, wait...

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:13.910
Really, words are so hard...

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.660
Goodnight, Tsutsun.
Today
Where are you right now?
I want to talk about yesterday...

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.870
There's no reply...

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.540
and she's not in her classroom.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.620
How did it come to this?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.790
And after I had all that fun, too...

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.410
This is hopeless. My heart is rushing...

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:31.910
Whoa!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.040
Senpai?!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.790
H-huh? You're...

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:40.040
I-I'm Ayado from Year 1, Class A!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.830
I apologize for my rudeness yesterday!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:42.950
That wasn't rude.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:48.580
No, I was the only one talking...
Like we were already familiar... I'm really sorry.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.250
Ah. Oh, yeah. About the anime I like...

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:53.660
Uh, yes?

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:55.290
It's "Magical Girl Ezomichi."

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.750
I bought that magazine because
it has an interview with a voice actress I like.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.870
EXCITED

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.580
I was thinking about going to read it now.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:07.450
S-senpai, why don't you have a seat?!
I'd like to hear more about that!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:09.790
Oh, sorry. I'm looking for someone right now.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.870
But I definitely will when I get the chance.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:15.120
Okay! Next time, for sure! I'll always be right here!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.370
I'm so happy!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.330
Classification: Milk

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.620
I've been searching like this, but I can't find her...

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.660
I'm being avoided, huh?

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.660
There you are! Why aren't you in the classroom?!

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:40.200
They still treat me badly in the classroom.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:45.000
More importantly, can you make an opportunity
for Takanashi and me to hang out?

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:45.700
I refuse.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.040
What?! You're a crappy friend!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.410
Ishino...

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.700
I think you should choose people a little more carefully.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:55.410
What?! What's with that condescending attitude?!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.410
Can you not complain about that
until you get to be cooler than Takanashi?!

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.410
You're right.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.620
They'd go so far as to leave well-wishes for my death?!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.950
Pretending
she's
someone
else...

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:05.660
Ishino?!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:06.910
Did someone just call me?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.830
It's difficult as I thought to be in the classroom.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.040
The girl in our class with the best figure?

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.000
It's gotta be Ayado, right?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:21.330
Yeah! Her figure's all she's got going for her.
What a shame, right?

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.160
She's seriously gloomy.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.250
Ayado? Ayado...
She's seriously gloomy.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.330
Ayado? Ayado...

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.290
Oh! Ayado!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:33.000
U-um... go ahead, Senpai. Please don't worry about it...

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.200
Ayado, what anime do you like?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:38.620
Huh?

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:43.330
As for me, besides Ezomichi, "Nose Blade"
had a lot of tear-jerking elements, so I like it.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:47.660
When it comes to actresses,
I guess I like Tada Moriko or Toki Fujishiro.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.790
Other than anime, I watch
all the sentai shows without fail.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:55.540
Could he be acting like he didn't hear those boys talking?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.660
M-me too! I watch the sentai shows, too!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:18:59.660
Oh?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.700
And this season, Gunfire Sentai is very well done.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.000
Yeah, it is! It's rich with unprecedented
character design, right?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:10.790
Especially with pink being an ex-bar hostess,
that's a novel idea...

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.450
Whoa!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:17.120
I-I'm sorry... It's because
they're always making fun of me.

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.660
That's because I'm weird...

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.700
When I talk to people, I get so nervous...

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:27.540
But when I thought that we had the same interests,
I just had to talk to you.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.330
I'm sorry.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.410
First of all, stop your crying!

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:33.290
I don't understand why this is good!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.500
Please don't mind me...

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:40.500
Earlier, there were flowers on top of my desk.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.620
I could throw them away, but if you wanna take them...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.450
Huh? Yes...

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:49.200
Also, I'm not a normie or anything at all.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:50.500
Huh?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.080
I don't understand other people's emotions very well...

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:57.750
Communication with people
I'm close to is difficult. That's why...uh...

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:02.910
I think it's good to be praised about your body!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:19.080
What am I saying? Me cheering someone up?
Not in this lifetime...

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.620
What are you doing?!

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.450
You...

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.540
I can't believe you're giving flowers to another girl
even though you have such a pretty girlfriend!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.540
Since when have you been such a player?!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.330
Take another look in the mirror!
My... solar... plexus!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.200
Get him! Get him again!
It's a misunderstanding! Ishino! I can see your panties!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:43.580
Dammit. Of course I'm not giving someone else
flowers if I'm fighting with her!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.120
There she is!

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:52.540
Um... about yesterday... I'm sorry.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:56.200
I'm comfortable feeling inferior.

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.000
Since that's been my way of life up to now,
there's no other way for me...

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.750
That isn't what's wrong.

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:01.410
Huh?

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:06.040
But I think you said that you sometimes have a problem
with me thinking I'm so inferior to others.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.540
I'm sorry...

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:11.290
I don't understand what things
I should try not to say. Can you explain that to me?

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:15.160
Why don't you understand that? Jeez...
